# portlink-landing — public marketing site. No Supabase backend.
#
# Secret-free template. Real values live in 1Password (vault: Portlink) and are
# injected at runtime — never written to disk:
#
#   op run --env-file=.env.op -- npm run dev
#
# Email (Resend) — contact / waitlist form delivery.
RESEND_API_KEY=op://cypqkqoeuibf4f6aud47v3qooa/lhylbglnfx7vy7yenlxn2tfehm/credential

# Non-secret site config. ADMIN_EMAIL receives pilot requests, Seatrade lead notifications and
# CSV exports; on the live site it is set in the Netlify env (all contexts).
# ADMIN_EMAIL=david@portlink.app

# Seatrade funnel (docs/SEATRADE-MED-2026.md). Blobs need no credential on Netlify. For plain
# `next dev` without `netlify dev`, uncomment the two lines below:
# NETLIFY_SITE_ID=34ab2932-19da-44e5-b761-0bc83acc0055
# NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN=op://cypqkqoeuibf4f6aud47v3qooa/a7h7xyjwjlfmzsc4oaf6gmuoym/credential
